<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Florida Housing Finance Agency.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Florida Housing Finance Agency.</headline>
<text>
<p>FLORIDA HOUSING FINANCE AGENCY</p>
<p>RE: $15,625,000</p>
<p>HOUSING REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1997 SERIES A</p>
<p>(RIVERFRONT APARTMENTS PROJECT)</p>
<p>AMT</p>
<p>Effective at 10:00 A.M. E.D.T., Monday, April 7, 1997 all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>William R. Hough &amp; Co.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
